                <pb facs="0540" n="514" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v05/pg514"/>

                <head>249. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>The Eighth and final Plenary Session of the Conference was held from 6:30 to 7:28
                    p.m. on July 23 at the Palais des Nations. The Directive to the Foreign
                    Ministers (CF/DOC/25, <ref target="#d257">Document 257</ref>) was approved and
                    each of the Heads of Government made a closing statement. For texts of these
                    statements, see <hi rendition="#italic">Geneva Conference</hi>, pages 76–82, or
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Cmd</hi>. 9543, pages 25–29. The United States
                    Delegation verbatim record of this session, USDEL/Verb/8, July 23, and the
                    record of decisions, CF/DOC/RD/13, July 23, are in Department of State,
                    Conference Files: Lot 63 D 123, CF 510.</p>
            </div>
